                   | Failure Window       |
                   | Slow Call Window     |
                   | Counters             |
                   | HALF_OPEN control    |
                   +----------+-----------+
                              |
                              v
                         HTTP Client
                              |
                              v
                         Dependency
And the breaker needs at least:
state
