48. Circuit breaker does not solve everything
It does not solve:
database corruption
It does not solve:
bad deployment
It does not solve:
infinite retry
It does not solve:
wrong timeout
It does not solve:
thread pool exhaustion
It does not solve:
memory leak
It's one component of resilience.
Think:
Timeout
   +
Retry
   +
Circuit Breaker
   +
Bulkhead
   +
