Suppose:
attempt 1 -> timeout
attempt 2 -> timeout
attempt 3 -> success
Breaker sees:
ONE logical call
SUCCESS
This can make sense when you want the breaker to answer:
"Is the overall operation succeeding?"
This prevents individual retry attempts from immediately inflating breaker statistics.
