    ↓
protected capacity

Recommendation
    ↓
separate capacity

Product search
    ↓
separate DB/HTTP limits
Conceptually:
                   Order Service
                        |
       +----------------+----------------+
       |                |                |
    Payment          Inventory      Recommendations
      |                  |                |
   Bulkhead           Bulkhead         Bulkhead
      |                  |                |
