32. A useful principle: reject as early as possible
Suppose a request is obviously invalid or over quota.
Don't let it travel through:
CDN
→ Load Balancer
→ Java
→ DB
→ external API
before rejecting it.
Ideally:
Internet
   |
   v
WAF / Gateway
   |
   X 429
The earlier you reject, the less infrastructure the request consumes.
This is load shedding at the edge.
________________________________________
33. But don't put every policy at the edge
The gateway might not know:
Does this request cost 1 or 20 tokens?
because that requires application/business knowledge.
So:
