18. The key design
Your key should identify the quota subject.
Examples:
rate:user:{userId}
rate:api-key:{apiKey}
rate:tenant:{tenantId}
rate:ip:{ip}
For endpoint-specific quotas:
rate:user:{userId}:endpoint:{endpoint}
But be careful.
If you blindly combine:
