2. Our Token Bucket model
For each key:
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│ capacity = 100               │
│ refill = 10 tokens/sec       │
│                              │
│ tokens = 73                  │
│ lastRefill = T               │
└──────────────────────────────┘
Interpretation:
capacity
   ↓
maximum burst

refill rate
   ↓
long-term sustainable rate
So:
