means a user could immediately consume 100 tokens if the bucket is full, but over a long period their average rate approaches 10 requests/sec.
________________________________________
3. Don't use a scheduled refill thread
A beginner implementation might do:
@Scheduled(fixedRate = 100)
void refill() {
    // add tokens
}
Don't.
Imagine:
1 million users
You don't want:
1 million buckets
       ×
scheduled refill work
